{"root":"bakal","ipa":"/ˈbakal/","core":"将要，预备，候选人，原材料","pos":["动词","名词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈbakal/","zh":"指将要发生的事物、未来的状态或作为原材料的物质，也指候选人。","phrases":[{"t":"bakal calon","zh":"候选人"},{"t":"bakal suami","zh":"未婚夫"},{"t":"bakal terjadi","zh":"即将发生"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia adalah bakal pemimpin masa depan.","zh":"他是未来的领导人选。"},{"t":"Kayu ini bakal menjadi meja.","zh":"这块木头将要被做成桌子。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bakal","ipa":"/ˈbakal/","zh":"将要，预备","phrase":{"t":"bakal istri","zh":"未婚妻"},"example":{"t":"Hujan bakal turun sore ini.","zh":"今天傍晚将要下雨。"}},{"w":"membakalkan","ipa":"/məmˈbakalkan/","zh":"预备某物作为原材料","phrase":{"t":"membakalkan bahan","zh":"预备原材料"},"example":{"t":"Mereka membakalkan kayu untuk perabot.","zh":"他们预备了木材来制作家具。"}},{"w":"pembakal","ipa":"/pəmˈbakal/","zh":"预备者，原材料提供者","phrase":{"t":"pembakal utama","zh":"主要提供者"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah pembakal bahan baku pabrik ini.","zh":"他是这家工厂原材料的提供者。"}}],"derSlugs":["bakal","membakalkan","pembakal"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:29:40.623Z","src":"base"}